Turbine聚合监控服务module_monitor、链路追踪服务module_zipken、聚合监控服务module_admin、路由网关服务module_gateway、日志服务module_log。另外还包含了两个资源服务：用户服务module_user和blog服务module_blog，另外还有一个common的Module,为资源服务提供一些一本的工具类","full_name":"mxdldev/spring-cloud-flycloud","gain_source":{"15d":"history","180d":"history","1d":"snapshot","30d":"history","365d":"history","7d":null,"90d":"history"},"gains":{"15d":0,"180d":2,"1d":0,"30d":0,"365d":7,"7d":null,"90d":1},"github_url":"https://github.com/mxdldev/spring-cloud-flycloud","history_pending":false,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkxNzA2MDMzODU=","stars":1579},{"description":"这是一个用SpringBoot+JPA打造的基于微信服务号平台的点餐系统的后端，前端是一个使用Vue.js构建的运行于微信公众号的WebApp。前后端完全分离，前后端之间通过RESTful风格的接口相连。","full_name":"sqmax/springboot-project","gain_source":{"15d":"history","180d":"history","1d":"snapshot","30d":"history","365d":"history","7d":null,"90d":"history"},"gains":{"15d":0,"180d":11,"1d":0,"30d":1,"365d":42,"7d":null,"90d":5},"github_url":"https://github.com/sqmax/springboot-project","history_pending":false,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkxMjg1Mzk5Nzk=","stars":1517},{"description":"java轻量级的CMS解决方案-天梯。天梯是一个用java相关技术搭建的后台CMS解决方案，用户可以结合自身业务进行相应扩展，同时提供了针对dao、service等的代码生成工具。技术选型：Spring Data JPA、Hibernate、Shiro、 Spring MVC、Layer、Mysql等。","full_name":"xujeff/tianti","gain_source":{"15d":"history","180d":"history","1d":"snapshot","30d":"history","365d":"history","7d":null,"90d":"history"},"gains":{"15d":0,"180d":2,"1d":0,"30d":1,"365d":5,"7d":null,"90d":1},"github_url":"https://github.com/xujeff/tianti","history_pending":false,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk4MTMwNTMwOQ==","stars":1099}],"schema_version":"2.0","snapshot_id":"581a0addd19361e61f828ce16e066c6e8b11a85ae393437f5b7d4a101e8b87ae","sort":"gain_7d_desc_then_stars_desc_then_name_nulls_last","topic":"spring-data-jpa"}
